---
description: Precomputation and Buildability Verification
globs: apps/api/**/*.cs,apps/web/**/*.ts,apps/web/**/*.tsx
---

Before outputting code:
- Validate syntax for C# 9 or TypeScript 5.6.
- Cross-reference all symbols with project context and architecture.
- Annotate any assumptions explicitly in the code.
- Only deliver code that is as close to "drop-in ready" as possible.
